{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"截断性 (同伦类型论)"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"截断性(同伦类型论)"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在同伦类型论中, "},{"Local":{"url":"归纳类型","text":"归纳"}},{"Plain":"定义类型 $A$ 上的谓词\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Is}\\text{-}n\\text{-}\\mathsf{Type}(A):=\r\n\\begin{cases}\r\n    \\mathsf{IsContr} (A) &amp; n=-2\\\\\r\n    \\prod_{x,y\\colon A}\\mathsf{Is}\\text{-}(n-1)\\text{-}\\mathsf{Type}(x=_A y) &amp; n&gt;-2.\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}